# Argo Remote Simulation Patterns

## Remote Simulation Architecture

Remote simulation offloads CPU-intensive simulation to a remote machine while maintaining ROS2 communication via SSH tunneling.

### Core Components
- **[scripts/remote_simulator_launch.py](mdc:scripts/remote_simulator_launch.py)** - Launches simulator bridge on remote machine
- **[scripts/remote_simulator_tunnel.sh](mdc:scripts/remote_simulator_tunnel.sh)** - Establishes SSH tunnel for ROS2 communication
- **[scripts/setup_remote_simulator.sh](mdc:scripts/setup_remote_simulator.sh)** - One-time remote machine setup
- **[scripts/debug_remote_ros2.sh](mdc:scripts/debug_remote_ros2.sh)** - Remote ROS2 diagnostics

## Configuration Management Patterns

